commit eeaa034cb1e520ea10e806870f6026cf1bb6c4f7
Author: antonio <antoniorees74@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 22 11:01:06 2026 +0100

    observability: promote nested runtime payload facts to top level
    
    opencode events nest tool names, titles, and text under part/state/properties
    maps. Downstream consumers (run-loop progress summaries, durable operation
    journal, web timeline) only read top-level payload keys, so every event
    rendered as a generic 'runtime' row with empty tool names.
    
    promoteObservablePayloadFields() lifts tool/name/title/detail/text/delta/
    output/message/state/status/action/phase from nested maps (depth 4,
    deterministic traversal) onto the payload top level in mapEvent(), without
    overwriting existing top-level values.

